    "language": "[0]All right. So in this scenario, I'm gonna overlap on the right side of my teammate to make space and hopefully shoot on goal. [1]Um, as I start to pass my teammate, I see that the opponent hasn't moved closer to me, so I think I'll have a good amount of space to shoot. [2][3]So as the defender... As the ball comes to me, the defender's getting very close, so I don't know if I'll have a lot of space to go forward, so I'm gonna try to move back wider. [4][5]Um, as I receive the ball, I see that I have the chance to go forward, so I'm going to dribble forward and shoot. [6]Yeah.[7] And I shot successfully, and the defender was not able to defend it.",
